      "disposition": "active",
      "notes": "First leg of the code flow: PKCE authorization URL plus the random state and verifier the module mints and pm-core keeps in its pending-login record (CodeQL go/constant-oauth2-state closed 2026-10-23 by moving the state mint into the module)."
    },
