        "connectors/idpi/oidc/tests/integration/keycloak_test.go"
      ],
      "disposition": "active",
      "notes": "Second leg: code exchange, id token verified (issuer, signature, audience or azp, nonce), claims extracted. Happy path covered by the Keycloak integration test only through the error path (no browser in CI); pm-core login (slice 4b) exercises it end to end."
    },
